{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "212a564f54673422f2e18ad66747e0534c4692dcf5ab75ac12b8373ee9a87490", "ja": "紗代子の燃える想い", "zh": "纱代子燃烧的心意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3976e6d77d4c0076192183abffc4b085f139730c684db3d08bb4038dcab056f2", "ja": "最終リハも終わり、明日はいよいよ劇場での\nお披露目公演。紗代子が資料を送ると、\nメンバー達が劇場へと戻ってくる。明日に\n備えて帰宅するよう諭すプロデューサー。\nみんなで盛り上がれる打ち上げを約束する。", "zh": "『闪光☆HANABI团』结束最终排练，\n明天即将在剧场举办首次亮相公演。\n收到纱代子传的资料，成员们陆续回到剧场。\n为了替明天备战，制作人劝她们早点回家。\n众人许下约定，要在庆功宴时玩得更尽兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "839c099e3d5baae3041071d7389502bc23a5c3843ad844a98064a1a6fdd18130", "ja": "（閃光☆HANABI団の最終リハーサルが終わった。\n明日は、劇場でのユニットお披露目公演だ！）", "zh": "（『闪光☆HANABI团』的最终排练结束了。\n明天即将在剧场举办团体首次亮相公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2deb53386990691c23c1d32f2bad16077cc780d7026f87922d498c95c641ffa1", "ja": "（みんな、今日はさすがに帰ったみたいだな。\nひとり寂しく、資料の整理でもするか……）", "zh": "（大家今天应该都回去了。\n我就孤单一个人来整理资料吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "d55d170cfea39abcc72437a07d7618425a08d950591a24ac80961518eebebe6c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n你辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "21fd698e9405926b7a0ed0fc65b4b385e32b5ace294126f8d6f453bf39f674ad", "ja": "え……紗代子？　こんな時間まで、どうしたんだ。\nみんなと帰ったんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "咦……纱代子？你怎么留到这么晚？\n你不是和大家一起回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "a2a9a984915c3d76c47f6e7a35e72401f7e6bf4aefad2963c084facb68844faf", "ja": "そのつもりだったんですけど、\n明日の資料を整理しておきたくて……。", "zh": "我本来是打算要回去的，\n但又想先整理一下明天的资料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "874f80da6df79d813404307c0f8ed121460337f16fb4587bddf22aae9119a83c", "ja": "リハで変更があったところなんかを、\nまとめ直していたところです！", "zh": "我正在把排练时有变更的地方，\n全部一并作修正！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "84c752d88a870d3792b2c300d1d59a69683f94bee82d8f4d0f30682b09c9df02", "ja": "今からやろうと思ってたところだ……ありがとう。\nでも明日は公演本番だし、あまり無理しないようにな。", "zh": "那是我原本接下来要做的事……谢谢你。\n不过明天就是正式公演了，别太勉强自己啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "dab31ae4cabe68f3f4f7b63a158a15712d9ed456ac04a7b07ce2ed3b435600e0", "ja": "はい。でも、好きでやってることですから。\nそれに私……明日が、すごく楽しみなんです！", "zh": "好，但这是我自己情愿做的啊。\n而且……我非常期待明天的到来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "a75bc17239f9ba5af63a9f21d2c858b2997e681d7e6d080c7ad05d755486702b", "ja": "だから、ちっとも大変なんかじゃないんですよ。\n{$P$}の手伝いもできますし！", "zh": "所以这些事一点都不累人喔。\n况且还能帮上{$P$}的忙啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "640b0cf0dc49c443c2170fd4d17f95fff27d365fdc3da26dc5c8c4d5aaea8d31", "ja": "そうか。\n助かるけど、本当に無理はしないでくれよ？", "zh": "这样啊。\n你确实帮了我大忙，但真的不要勉强喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "1525b941a8a951dddb42cb95a486ace80bcdb2f96331f704c25904234567086e", "ja": "はい、わかってます！　ふふっ。", "zh": "嗯，我知道！呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "64dd915fe6d05632a988f5ad24952106165a0b1e44bfb054afbbfc9b66917464", "ja": "うん、これで大丈夫そう。\nあとは必要なものを、メールでみんなに送信……と。", "zh": "嗯，这样应该就没问题了。\n再来只要把必备品用简讯告诉大家……好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c1a552787e1a709624fc2b0d125b590d9bab19f99a8afb6deb6cf106b999996c", "ja": "紗代子、終わったのか？　お疲れさま！", "zh": "纱代子，忙完了吗？辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "3c10282514a370f67c60359f2784d340130ccaa1e73f4cd0048768bb80c0230b", "ja": "はい！　……それにしても、\n今回のライブは、本当に盛りだくさんですね。", "zh": "是的！……不过话又说回来，\n这次演唱会的内容真的很丰富呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "47f5370e279bf6fed93299a25ccee0ca306ed15efad197693ce52f42c04294f7", "ja": "お披露目公演の後は、海のステージ。\n夏祭り風の屋台に、オリジナルメニュー……。", "zh": "首次亮相公演之后，就轮到海边舞台。\n还有夏日祭典风格的摊贩、原创菜色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "4ded3d12f5543b395f7b2cbd2bff888d2bdd22d64cd04af93234ca6e42cf57ad", "ja": "私たち閃光☆HANABI団が、全力で用意した\nライブです。楽しいステージになるといいなぁ……♪", "zh": "这是我们『闪光☆HANABI团』尽全力准备的演唱会。\n希望能带来一场开心的表演……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "37f66b79f9037ee60a462fe072f422e068c2cf4ba101b4b8c3defb297ca44bf9", "ja": "そうだな。最初に紗代子たちが設営を手伝うって\n言い出した時は、少し迷ったんだけど……。", "zh": "对啊，而且起初纱代子你们想帮忙搭建舞台的时候，\n我还有点犹豫的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "6955385b9fc86cc033f8139bec7a53fef8873cb908acd97642ff6cddaced0eb9", "ja": "そうなんですか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "65cfc273b33f0ff83a3bab7c874bd7e1dd02c47e6b76288a4332666bfaa2ef20", "ja": "ああ。当然だけど、負担が増える事になるし……\nでも、みんなを信じて任せる事にした。", "zh": "嗯，因为这铁定会增加你们的负担……\n不过我后来还是决定要相信并托付给你们大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "8c51de9f3a9f4a1df422c3142d8c605c8a1e0d327ce10c0310e31c425d422069", "ja": "信じてもらえて良かったです。\nこんなに楽しい経験、なかなかできませんから。", "zh": "能获得你的信任真是太好了，\n这么开心的经验可是很难得的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "aec2f9003e7bf2740ca5f940aa9f0da7648b1bfe06f8c709af358ef1d56057de", "ja": "{$P$}。\n私たちを信じてくれて、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n谢谢你相信我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "8d9744ba812e0e862953fab69d322c01fe3a3b64735694cb82e1c7d8643b8619", "ja": "こちらこそ、ありがとう。\n明日のお披露目公演も、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "我才要说谢谢。\n明天的首次亮相公演也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "e902d1c35426eaeae621e174568aba2a88724cbe3c445bc629c79d6819f691c6", "ja": "はいっ！　……あれ？\n何か聞こえてきませんか、{$P$}。", "zh": "好的！……奇怪？\n{$P$}，你有没有听见什么声音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "21969c2359e8e41eedb88846dd29a1d97c90c4c8da2a462b9d73298c6b42d297", "ja": "紗代子ー！　やっぱり、ここにおったんか。", "zh": "纱代子～！就知道你在这里吼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "c85b062f9bcaf50f6f2f59a2b9301cc89cd8afe3e8c3c1710741dd7c0ec4ccec", "ja": "あーっ、ズルいよ、さよちん！\nひとりでレッスンしてたんでしょ！？", "zh": "啊～纱纱你好贼喔！\n你是不是一个人在做训练！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "fff906163e47c5ed856d000d186e75438a36e02a610bde88f31fe329343720c6", "ja": "いや事務室でレッスンはせんやろ……。\nあ、{$P$}さんもお疲れさまです♪", "zh": "吼唷，谁会在事务室做训练呀……\n啊，{$P$}先生也辛苦啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "cc3fecfe139bddcd2b7bb429bcb251f6e41cc07121fcebbfab01dfcf5f3e2d79", "ja": "え！？　奈緒ちゃんに、海美！？\nどうしてここが……。", "zh": "咦！？小绪和海美！？\n你们怎么知道我在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "4a19240688c2a780ee6fe5dd6470658626bb659c9909f2bd7157cbf36ef55d97", "ja": "帰ろうと思ったんだけど、話がつきなくて！\nファミレスでお茶してたんだよね。", "zh": "我们本来要回家，但话聊不完！\n所以我们就跑去家庭餐厅喝茶了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "eaedb35d8f5a2f27202f93b6dfaa95eb952e80ff66be2778a8cede7632a2a1e8", "ja": "そしたら、紗代子ちゃんからメールが来るから\nビックリしちゃった！", "zh": "然后就收到纱代子传来的简讯，\n我们吓了一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "7eca9acaba7a60602269c63dbd111e826a8cc9b222a2c55797e388d0cbfc0e21", "ja": "こんな時間にメールしてくるなんて、\n絶対劇場にいる！って話になったんだよね～。", "zh": "我们就开始聊说～\n「居然在这种时间传简讯来，她绝对在剧场！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "73e27bf720429827fdbc7803485b14402cdc8a99a6fc565bbe5c6135ca9096c1", "ja": "美奈子さんにのり子さんまで……。", "zh": "连美奈子和法子也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d08af42dc6dce71a1d34442d5b7cd9c0c7bcf09fe77ba8529fedcfdf0093afe4", "ja": "だからって、なんで全員揃って劇場に来るんだ……\nいいからみんな、早く家に帰って寝なさい！", "zh": "就算如此，为什么你们所有人都跑来剧场了……\n好了，大家赶快回家睡觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
